>SURFACE 1
#^^^^^^^ source.phreeqc keyword.control.phreeqc
#       ^ source.phreeqc
#        ^ source.phreeqc constant.numeric.phreeqc
># 1 g soil = 0.7% Organic Matter ~ 3.5 mg Organic Carbon.
#^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.phreeqc comment.line.number-sign.phreeqc
># 7.1 meq charge per g OC
